{"4019220":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Dressmaker","steam_appid":4019220,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elige la tela, prepara y corta las piezas según los patrones, cose las prendas y añádeles decoraciones. <i>Dressmaker<\/i> es un relajante juego de costura donde podrás crear los atuendos de tus sueños con todas las herramientas a tu alcance.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Confecciones realistas y palpables<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elige cómo disponer las piezas y si vas a cortar los patrones al hilo o al bies. Tus decisiones quedarán plasmadas en el atuendo final. Utiliza telas diferentes para las distintas piezas y haz realidad tu visión creativa.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/25edb1280d57e7d270c5945a01e7305d.poster.avif?t=1790484978\" aria-label=\"A short video showing pattern pieces being cut out of a roll of fabric on a cutting table. The cut fabric is added to the player&#039;s inventory.\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/25edb1280d57e7d270c5945a01e7305d.webm?t=1790484978\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/25edb1280d57e7d270c5945a01e7305d.mp4?t=1790484978\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Una máquina de coser con canilla infinita<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elige el color del hilo y cose las piezas con una máquina de coser de época.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/c890fe187d93532c9b859689102b6eea.poster.avif?t=1790484978\" aria-label=\"A short video showing fabric going through a vintage sewing machine\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/c890fe187d93532c9b859689102b6eea.webm?t=1790484978\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/c890fe187d93532c9b859689102b6eea.mp4?t=1790484978\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>El costurero de tus sueños<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decora tus prendas con botones, lazos y apliques. Añádeles encaje y otros accesorios donde quieras. ¡Da rienda suelta a tu creatividad!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/c131c8847b03b174c1b17055e22972c0.poster.avif?t=1790484978\" aria-label=\"A short video demonstrating white buttons being placed onto a dress\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/c131c8847b03b174c1b17055e22972c0.webm?t=1790484978\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/c131c8847b03b174c1b17055e22972c0.mp4?t=1790484978\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Un conjunto para cada ocasión<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conoce a los habitantes del pueblo, deseosos de llenar sus armarios con atuendos hechos a medida y acorde a sus gustos y eventos importantes. Crea prendas para impresionarlos o expón tus propios diseños en tu escaparate y véndelos.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/e40ff51d0ab4bb0b4609b299b3b07494.poster.avif?t=1790484978\" aria-label=\"A short video showing a customer entering the store. She says, &amp;quot;Dressmaker! There&#039;s an evening ball at the duke&#039;s - I call him Edmund - Edmund&#039;s mansion. Glamourous? Yes. Elegant? But of course. My budget is 1000.&amp;quot;\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/e40ff51d0ab4bb0b4609b299b3b07494.webm?t=1790484978\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/e40ff51d0ab4bb0b4609b299b3b07494.mp4?t=1790484978\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compra una gran selección de tejidos, incluyendo algodón, lino, lana, seda, terciopelo y muchas más.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usa tu cuaderno de bocetos para diseñar y colorear tus atuendos, y añade muestras de tela y apliques.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dispón los patrones, corta la tela, ayúdate de tu maniquí y cóselo todo junto.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entrega tus creaciones a la clientela local para mejorar tu reputación y ganar dinero.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acaricia al gatito.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elige la tela, prepara y corta las piezas según los patrones, cose las prendas y añádeles decoraciones. <i>Dressmaker<\/i> es un relajante juego de costura donde podrás crear los atuendos de tus sueños con todas las herramientas a tu alcance.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Confecciones realistas y palpables<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elige cómo disponer las piezas y si vas a cortar los patrones al hilo o al bies. Tus decisiones quedarán plasmadas en el atuendo final. Utiliza telas diferentes para las distintas piezas y haz realidad tu visión creativa.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/25edb1280d57e7d270c5945a01e7305d.poster.avif?t=1790484978\" aria-label=\"A short video showing pattern pieces being cut out of a roll of fabric on a cutting table. The cut fabric is added to the player&#039;s inventory.\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/25edb1280d57e7d270c5945a01e7305d.webm?t=1790484978\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/25edb1280d57e7d270c5945a01e7305d.mp4?t=1790484978\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Una máquina de coser con canilla infinita<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elige el color del hilo y cose las piezas con una máquina de coser de época.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/c890fe187d93532c9b859689102b6eea.poster.avif?t=1790484978\" aria-label=\"A short video showing fabric going through a vintage sewing machine\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/c890fe187d93532c9b859689102b6eea.webm?t=1790484978\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/c890fe187d93532c9b859689102b6eea.mp4?t=1790484978\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>El costurero de tus sueños<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decora tus prendas con botones, lazos y apliques. Añádeles encaje y otros accesorios donde quieras. ¡Da rienda suelta a tu creatividad!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/c131c8847b03b174c1b17055e22972c0.poster.avif?t=1790484978\" aria-label=\"A short video demonstrating white buttons being placed onto a dress\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/c131c8847b03b174c1b17055e22972c0.webm?t=1790484978\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/c131c8847b03b174c1b17055e22972c0.mp4?t=1790484978\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Un conjunto para cada ocasión<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conoce a los habitantes del pueblo, deseosos de llenar sus armarios con atuendos hechos a medida y acorde a sus gustos y eventos importantes. Crea prendas para impresionarlos o expón tus propios diseños en tu escaparate y véndelos.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4019220\/extras\/e40ff51d0ab4bb0b4609b299b3b07494.poster.avif?t=1790484978\" aria-label=\"A short video showing a customer entering the store. She says, &amp;quot;Dressmaker! There&#039;s an evening ball at the duke&#039;s - I call him Edmund - Edmund&#039;s mansion. Glamourous? Yes. Elegant? But of course. My budget is 1000.&amp;quot;\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shar